[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":96},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:4":3},{"posts":4,"total":86,"tags":87,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,32,40,48,56,64,72,78],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"六角 Discord 討論王","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-02-22-hex-discord-king","2022\u002F02\u002F22","2022-02-22","在 Discord 的討論頻道中，同學可以針對課程中的任何資源及知識進行討論，甚至也會不藏私地把自己的心得筆記分享給大家，在六角 Discord 頻道中，你可以透過「發言」的方式提升等級，每當升級時系統會給予提示，並給予額外的獎勵稱號。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F02%2F22%2FUntitled.png?alt=media&token=f18d1462-348b-44cd-8d74-bc3c631ff640",[13],"event",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"【4月開班】Node.js 後端工程師養成直播班","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-02-17-node-training-intro","2022\u002F02\u002F17","2022-02-17","Node.js 後端工程師養成直播班，即將在 2022 年 4 月開班。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F02%2F17%2Fa39fc1cfe9ead6c7-1.png?alt=media&token=124d8724-cfa5-494d-8896-53f76ca041f9",[22],"course",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"想要轉職前端工程師？業務背景也能轉職成前端工程師！","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-01-05-sales-to-frontend","2022\u002F01\u002F05","2022-01-05","從事業務約八年的 AWEI，做得有點疲乏，決定轉往前端領域看看。在其他人眼中他就是有很多問題的問題兒童，他想要告訴我們：「不要害怕問問題，程式不會就是不會！」AWEI 花了八個月學習，終於成功轉職為前端工程師！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F01%2FBlog-08.png?alt=media&token=c08fef46-2595-4c9e-b2ee-d785a2b9b837",[31],"interview",{"title":33,"link":34,"date":35,"dateTime":36,"description":37,"thumbnail":38,"tags":39},"業務轉職前端工程師！跟著六角一起勇往直前","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-23-alec-to-frontend","2021\u002F12\u002F23","2021-12-23","非本科系畢業的 Alec，三十歲以前做過的工作都不太長久，直到接觸了前端，在學習的過程中堅定自己的信念，終於轉職成為前端工程師！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F21%2FBlog-06.png?alt=media&token=0d142a85-d047-45b1-bdcf-8329b42927c3",[31],{"title":41,"link":42,"date":43,"dateTime":44,"description":45,"thumbnail":46,"tags":47},"【轉職前端工程師】學習前端，年齡不是問題","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-22-every-age-learn-frontend","2021\u002F12\u002F22","2021-12-22","35 歲才決定轉職，真的可以做到嗎？如果你抱持著自己三四十歲就必須要很厲害的心態，當然會覺得年紀是個問題。但是宇宏想要告訴你，只要你覺得沒有問題，那就是沒有問題！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F21%2FBlog-05.png?alt=media&token=15965e37-994e-4cf2-89ef-ce3fa688358d",[31],{"title":49,"link":50,"date":51,"dateTime":52,"description":53,"thumbnail":54,"tags":55},"註冊六角課程，到底包含了哪些福利","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-21-hex-service","2021\u002F12\u002F21","2021-12-21","六角經營至今已經有上萬人加入，隨著時間前進我們也不斷地加入新的內容，這篇來重新介紹六角的課程到底有哪些額外的延伸內容吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fversion_2019%2F2023%2Flanding-2023-list.png?alt=media&token=aad511ea-50b9-4074-a5b8-5e4dd1f4a016",[13],{"title":57,"link":58,"date":59,"dateTime":60,"description":61,"thumbnail":62,"tags":63},"免費 25 小時前端教學資源","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-16-free-25","2021\u002F12\u002F16","2021-12-16","這篇文章我們規劃了適合「前端工程師」的學習地圖，讓新進的學生了解如何選擇課程，內容將一一介紹主要課程包含哪些內容囉。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F12%2Ffree-25%2F%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E8%A9%A6%E8%81%BD-01.png?alt=media&token=b11f69bf-95af-4624-ab28-6904131c1165",[13],{"title":65,"link":66,"date":67,"dateTime":68,"description":69,"thumbnail":70,"tags":71},"2021 前端工程師薪水調查","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-09-2021-frontend-salary","2021\u002F12\u002F09","2021-12-09","在 2021 年 10 月我們展開問卷調查，實際回收數為 438 份，本篇將分享數據給各位參考。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F12%2Ffrontend-salary-n%2F2021-Frontend-16.png?alt=media&token=dd0a6ec1-bcff-4ce2-8332-1bcd39bf7ad7",[13],{"title":73,"link":74,"date":67,"dateTime":68,"description":75,"thumbnail":76,"tags":77},"前端工程師第一份工作平均起薪與採用技術調查","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-09-frontend-first-salary","很多正在考慮轉職的朋友，都想知道轉職成前端工程師的薪水如何？前端起薪真的有比較高嗎？我需要擁有怎樣的技術才能真正找到一份前端的工作？本次調查將根據這幾個部分進行解析。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F12%2Ffirst-frontend-n%2F2021-Frontend-2--10.png?alt=media&token=00f908e8-555d-47ef-8314-d78fe31d8204",[13],{"title":79,"link":80,"date":81,"dateTime":82,"description":83,"thumbnail":84,"tags":85},"Bootstrap 5 有什麼新特色!?","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-10-25-bootstrap-intro","2021\u002F10\u002F25","2021-10-25","接下來，我們預計在 10\u002F27 進行「 Bootstrap 5 網頁開發整合術」的課程介紹，歡迎你提前發問，我將在直播過程中一一回覆。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F10%2F25%2Fog.png?alt=media&token=787ab669-10c4-4456-b8d1-9354814a43d4",[13],116,[88,22,89,90,91,13,31,92,93,94,95],"UI design","css","css3","enterprise","javascript","jobs","skilltree","software engineer",1790064291623]